<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estimated interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Monday were 105,000 head, compared with 90,000 a week ago and 98,000 a year ago-USDA.</p>
<p>Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts steady, instances $0.50 higher than mid-session Friday. Trade light to moderate. Demand and offerings moderate.</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
